<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to 13 June -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to 13 June -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and related maerkets rose to $1.114 trillion in the week to June 12 from $981.08 billion in the previous week, International Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of dollars).</p>
<p>					    LATEST WEEK	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>WEEK</p>
